1
00:00:00,524 --> 00:00:03,314
(Leonard:)With a hologram? Nice.

2
00:00:03,568 --> 00:00:04,608
(Leonard:)Hey, do you see this?

3
00:00:04,778 --> 00:00:07,198
(Sheldon:)I'm in the matrix, Leonard,
I see everything.

4
00:00:08,031 --> 00:00:11,201
You gotta be kidding me.
You friended Stuart on Facebook?

5
00:00:11,368 --> 00:00:13,868
- I thought you didn't like Facebook.
- Don't be silly.

6
00:00:14,037 --> 00:00:17,747
(Sheldon:)I'm a fan of anything that tries to replace
actual human contact.

7
00:00:19,584 --> 00:00:22,794
(Raj:)Please. You're looking at Facebook
to find out how their date went.

8
00:00:22,963 --> 00:00:25,293
(Sheldon:)Really? You think I care if a man...

9
00:00:25,465 --> 00:00:29,715
...what, "Shared a pumpkin latte
with a dynamite lady"?

10
00:00:29,886 --> 00:00:34,306
- You're so full of it.
- You're free to believe whatever you like.

11
00:00:34,558 --> 00:00:37,688
(Sheldon:)And unfriend Rajesh Koothrappali.

12
00:00:37,853 --> 00:00:39,273
(Raj:)You unfriended me? Seriously?

13
00:00:39,438 --> 00:00:42,358
(Howard:)Oh, yeah. Now he's gonna miss
all those great updates like:

14
00:00:42,524 --> 00:00:44,024
"l can't believe I waited this Iong...

15
00:00:44,192 --> 00:00:46,652
...to make my own potpourri." Ha, ha.

16
00:00:47,863 --> 00:00:50,453
Why don't you acknowledge
you have feelings for Amy...

17
00:00:50,615 --> 00:00:52,825
...and don't want her going out
with other men?

18
00:00:52,993 --> 00:00:56,493
(Sheldon:)And unfriend Leonard Hofstadter.

19
00:00:56,705 --> 00:01:00,045
Here's a radical thought. Go old school.
Challenge Stuart to a fight.

